========================================================================
  PREAMBLE
========================================================================

This repository contains two distinct categories of material, each
governed by separate terms:

  (A) Code, scripts, SVG templates, README layout, workflows, and all
      non-artwork content (the "Code").

  (B) Original artwork, illustrations, character designs, drawn
      portraits, chibi avatars, and embedded character images contained
      in any file within this repository (the "Protected Artwork").

The Protected Artwork in this repository consists of, but is not
limited to:

  • assets/myavatar.png          — drawn profile image
  • assets/header-banner.svg     — contains embedded chibi OC avatar
      drawn by Nonaa, commissioned and owned by Mennahtullah Mabrouk

Any references to "Protected Artwork" throughout this license include
all current and future artwork files added to this repository unless
explicitly excluded in writing by both copyright holders.

