      commercial exploitation rights belong exclusively to
      Mennahtullah Mabrouk.

  (c) Nonaa retains the moral right of attribution as the original
      illustrator. Any use of the Protected Artwork must credit Nonaa.

  (d) Neither copyright holder has waived any rights under applicable
      copyright, trademark, or intellectual property law.

2.2  PROHIBITED USES (GENERAL)
-------------------------------

  Unless explicitly permitted in Section 2.3, the following uses of the
  Protected Artwork are strictly prohibited:

  (a) REPRODUCTION — Copying, duplicating, or redistributing the
      Protected Artwork in whole or in part, whether digitally or in
      physical form, including but not limited to printing, engraving,
      embossing, or any other medium.

  (b) MODIFICATION — Cropping, resizing, recoloring, overlaying text,
      applying filters, removing backgrounds, or making any derivative
      changes to the Protected Artwork.

  (c) COMMERCIAL EXPLOITATION — Using the Protected Artwork, or any
      recognizable portion thereof, for any commercial purpose without
      explicit written permission from Mennahtullah Mabrouk, including
      but not limited to:

        • Products for sale (merchandise, prints, stickers, clothing)
        • Branding, logos, or mascots
        • Advertising or promotional material
        • Paid digital content or NFTs
        • In-app assets or game content

  (d) ATTRIBUTION REMOVAL — Removing, obscuring, or failing to include
      required attribution as specified in Section 2.3.

  (e) IMPLDIED ENDORSEMENT — Using the Protected Artwork in any manner
      that implies sponsorship, endorsement, or affiliation with
      Mennahtullah Mabrouk, Nonaa, or any associated brand without
      written consent.

  (f) AI TRAINING — Using the Protected Artwork as input data for
      training, fine-tuning, or evaluating any machine learning model,
      generative AI system, or similar technology.

  (g) TRADEMARK USE — Registering or attempting to register the
      Protected Artwork or any substantially similar design as a
      trademark, service mark, or trade dress in any jurisdiction.

2.3  PERMITTED USE — FAN ART / REDRAW IN YOUR STYLE
-----------------------------------------------------

  Subject to ALL conditions below being met simultaneously, you ARE
  permitted to create your own original illustration inspired by or
  referencing the Protected Artwork ("Fan Art"), provided that:

  CONDITION 1 — ORIGINAL CREATION
    The Fan Art must be entirely drawn by you or by a human artist
    commissioned by you. The Fan Art must NOT be generated by AI,
    traced, photocopied, or otherwise mechanically reproduced from the
    Protected Artwork. Each element must be substantially your own
    original hand-drawn or digitally drawn work.

  CONDITION 2 — STYLE TRANSFORMATION
    The Fan Art must represent a meaningful reinterpretation in your
    own distinct artistic style. A reproduction that is merely a
    copy with minor superficial changes (e.g., slight recoloring,
    cropping, or resizing) does NOT satisfy this condition.

  CONDITION 3 — MANDATORY ATTRIBUTION (NON-NEGOTIABLE)
    Every instance of Fan Art MUST include clear, visible, and
    unremovable attribution containing ALL of the following:

      (i)   The name "Nonaa" or "@itsnonaa.a" credited as the
            ORIGINAL ARTIST / CHARACTER ILLUSTRATOR.

      (ii)  The name "Mennahtullah Mabrouk" or "@MennahtullahMabrouk"
            credited as the OWNER / COMMISSIONER of the original work.

      (iii) A statement that the original was a PAID COMMISSION, e.g.:
            "Original character commissioned by Mennahtullah Mabrouk,
             drawn by Nonaa (@itsnonaa.a)"

    Attribution must appear:

      (A) In the caption, description, or first comment of any post
          where the Fan Art is shared (e.g., Instagram, Twitter/X,
          TikTok, DeviantArt, ArtStation, Pixiv, Bluesky, Threads,
          Facebook, or any other platform).

      (B) Embedded within or directly adjacent to the image itself
          (e.g., watermark, signature, or text overlay) if the Fan Art
          is shared as a standalone image file.

      (C) In the repository README or description if the Fan Art is
          included in a GitHub repository.

    FAILURE TO PROVIDE ANY OF THE ABOVE ATTRIBUTION ELEMENTS
    CONSTITUTES A COPYRIGHT VIOLATION AND MAY RESULT IN:

      • A DMCA takedown notice
      • A formal cease-and-desist letter
      • Legal proceedings for copyright infringement
      • Claims for damages and attorney's fees

  CONDITION 4 — NO MISREPRESENTATION
    You must not present the Fan Art as the original work, as official
    content, or as produced by or affiliated with Mennahtullah Mabrouk
    or Nonaa.

  CONDITION 5 — NON-COMMERCIAL USE (DEFAULT)
    Fan Art created under this section is permitted for non-commercial
    use only. If you wish to sell, monetize, or commercially exploit
    Fan Art based on the Protected Artwork, you MUST obtain prior
    written permission from BOTH copyright holders:

      Mennahtullah Mabrouk — https://github.com/MennahtullahMabrouk
      Nonaa                — https://www.instagram.com/itsnonaa.a/

  CONDITION 6 — NO AI GENERATION
    Fan Art must be created by a human artist. You may not use AI
    tools (e.g., Midjourney, DALL-E, Stable Diffusion, Leonardo AI,
    or any similar service) to generate, iterate, or partially
    produce the Fan Art.

